{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓金󱼈，以抉四眼無明之膜，令一切處悉見遮那佛性之指。偏權疑碎，加之以刪。假夢\n寄客，立以賓主。觀者恕之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音披梵書伊字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一穴切，音淵入聲。挑也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音莫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呼徃切。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音刈，睡語\n也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音鑛，鉤猛切。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音觸，牴也，據也，突也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "量，示具是示體"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無心是色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "造心是心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸行無常是生滅法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0581001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0581001", "type": "orig", "text": "名下一有不字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0582001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0582001", "type": "orig", "text": "猶一作由"}
{"id": null, "n": "0587001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0587001", "type": "orig", "text": "至一作示"}
{"id": null, "n": "0587002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0587002", "type": "orig", "text": "四十六問一作餘四十五"}
{"id": null, "n": "0591001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0591001", "type": "orig", "text": "是福一作福德"}
{"id": null, "n": "0591002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0591002", "type": "orig", "text": "徙疑徒"}
{"id": null, "n": "0594001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0594001", "type": "orig", "text": "十上一有滿字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0595001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0595001", "type": "orig", "text": "教上一有權字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0596001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0596001", "type": "orig", "text": "若下一有有字次同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0597001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0597001", "type": "orig", "text": "爾一作今"}
{"id": null, "n": "0597002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0597002", "type": "orig", "text": "宣弘作弘演"}
